[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800100_02_0010","text":"好安静的夜晚啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800100_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800100_02_0020","text":"呵呵……\n侧耳倾听的话……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800100_02_0030","text":"簌簌……簌簌……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800100_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800100_02_0040","text":"总觉得……从天上……\n能听到簌簌的声音……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800100_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800100_02_0050","text":"——……真的呢\n说起来，明天好像要下雪哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800100_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800100_02_0060","text":"也许这就是下雪前的宁静吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800100_02_0070","text":"如同低语一般，只能听到雪的声音……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800100_02_0080","text":"——也许是我太想早点见到雾子了吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800100_02_0090","text":"呵呵……是雪的……\n声音呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800100_02_0100","text":"我在等着哦……簌簌……"}]
